<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18321" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφίδρ-ῡμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thing set up,</i> esp. <i>image</i> of the gods (cf.<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> s.v.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1046.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
				112.115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.5.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῦς μόσχος, τὸ Αἰγυπτίων ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.256
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shrine, temple,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				13.29.1(2)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.2.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.4.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>copy taken from such image</i> or <i>shrine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				15.49
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερὸν Ἀσκληπιοῦ ἀ. τοῦ ἐν Τρίκκῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					8.4.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
